 a backpack' (27.10) has no meaning and the bag is a free warehouse.", "Was concept H (free-form builder) approved, and may concept G (craft by volume) be retried with other wording. Price: build UI work starts on a picture he has not said yes to, against the global design rule.", "Order of waves: ledger (M0), then craft/wear (M1), then sheets (W3), UI rebuild and terrain layers; the free editor needs the ledger and a server record of tools. Price: the editor adds a new matter flow before the ledger exists, and the ledger has to chase it."], "issues": ["docs/GDD-v4.md:34, 232, 235 still forbid the craft menu, free forging of shape and destruction of buildings, against Maxim's requests; task 63's critic notes the three parts each edit the KILL LIST differently.", "The Russian originals of Maxim's messages from 27.10-31.10 are not in the repo; only the translated briefs in the workflow scripts. I did not search the T3 thread transcripts.", "BuildSystem._wood_plan (systems/build_system.gd:501-548) ignores bag pieces, while grand_wood() (:166-174) counts them.", "Piece id is 4 bits and rotation 2 bits (systems/input_system.gd:16-19). Snapshot bits are mostly taken (only 56-62 free per the matter spec), so a free editor needs a separate network path.", "Tools and Bag are client state (world/items/bag.gd:27); consuming bag pieces for craft or build is a client claim until the server keeps a tool record (matter D11, critic §57).", "F5, F6 and F7 (EdgeCanvas, Craft, MatterLedger) exist only as designs in 63/matter/spec.md. Estimates there: M0 about 6.5 d, M1 12-14 d, plus 2-3 d for D11.", "Concept G_inventory_craft_v1.png was never generated (two moderation_blocked, category violence); H_freeform_build_3d_v1.png exists but its approval is not recorded.", "The hotbar of 7 real tools and the removal of text on the cuff are in feel-2's uncommitted work (hotbar.gd has 29 changed lines); I did not verify them.", "Range stocks (tool rack, ingots) are bottomless by design in 63/ui/world_buttons.md §4, a labelled hole in the law; a range editor would need the same label.", "Draw budget: the polygon tour stop is 292 of 300 (62/w2/polish/stage.md:15), so free-form pieces need merged meshes and culling.", "Whether runtime .glb/.obj import works in Godot 4.7 in the web build is not verified here; for arch.md and critic.md."]}

